      "exercise": "851",
      "grading": "ungraded",
      "source": "derived",
      "parts": [],
      "displayAnswer": "按题目原来写出的 $ax^2+bx+c=0$ 读取系数，负号也属于系数，缺少的项系数为 0：a) $a=2,b=17,c=3$；b) $a=5,b=-9,c=4$；c) $a=1,b=-12,c=-6$；d) $a=-1,b=1,c=-2$；e) $a=8,b=-7,c=0$；f) $a=1,b=0,c=-81$。首项系数等于 1 才叫简化的二次方程，所以题中只有 c)、f) 是简化的二次方程。d) 的首项系数是 -1，不能因它可以另行化为简化方程而把原式选进去。",
      "tasks": [
        {"label": "a)", "kind": "coefficient-triple", "coefficients": [2, 17, 3]},
        {"label": "b)", "kind": "coefficient-triple", "coefficients": [5, -9, 4]},
        {"label": "c)", "kind": "coefficient-triple", "coefficients": [1, -12, -6]},
        {"label": "d)", "kind": "coefficient-triple", "coefficients": [-1, 1, -2]},
        {"label": "e)", "kind": "coefficient-triple", "coefficients": [8, -7, 0]},
        {"label": "f)", "kind": "coefficient-triple", "coefficients": [1, 0, -81]},
        {"label": "monic selection", "kind": "monic-selection", "selectedLabels": ["c)", "f)"], "criterion": "a=1 in the equation as written"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "exercise": "852",
      "grading": "ungraded",
      "source": "derived",
      "parts": [],
      "displayAnswer": "在同一坐标系中画 $y=x^2$ 和 $y=x+2$。抛物线可取 $(-2,4),(-1,1),(0,0),(1,1),(2,4),(3,9)$，平滑连接；直线过 $(-2,0),(0,2)$。两条图象的交点是 $(-1,1)$ 和 $(2,4)$，把交点投影到横轴，读得方程的根 $x=-1,2$。在两个交点之间，抛物线位于直线下方，所以 $x^2<x+2$ 的解是 $-1<x<2$；在两端外侧，抛物线位于直线上方，所以 $x^2>x+2$ 的解是 $x<-1$ 或 $x>2$。两个不等式都是严格不等式，均不含端点 -1、2。校验：$x^2-x-2=(x+1)(x-2)$；在 $x=0$ 处差为 -2，在 $x=-2,3$ 处差均为 4，与图象上下关系一致。",
      "tasks": [
        {
          "label": "equation",
          "kind": "graphical-equation",
          "coefficients": [1, -1, -2],
          "line": {"slope": 1, "intercept": 2, "points": [[-2, 0], [0, 2]]},
          "graphReadRoots": [-1, 2],
          "graphReadIntersections": [[-1, 1], [2, 4]],
          "validationRoots": [-1, 2],
          "validationOnly": "$x^2-x-2=(x+1)(x-2)$"
        },
        {
          "label": "less than",
          "kind": "graphical-inequality",
          "relation": "<",
          "solution": "(-1,2)",
          "intervals": [{"lower": -1, "upper": 2, "lowerInclusive": false, "upperInclusive": false}],
          "graphReason": "The parabola is below the line between the intersections."
        },
        {
          "label": "greater than",
          "kind": "graphical-inequality",
          "relation": ">",
          "solution": "(-infinity,-1) union (2,infinity)",
          "intervals": [
            {"lower": null, "upper": -1, "lowerInclusive": false, "upperInclusive": false},
            {"lower": 2, "upper": null, "lowerInclusive": false, "upperInclusive": false}
          ],
          "graphReason": "The parabola is above the line outside the two intersections."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "exercise": "853",
      "grading": "ungraded",
      "source": "derived",
      "parts": [],
      "displayAnswer": "各题先除以首项系数，化为 $x^2=-\\frac ba x-\\frac ca$。在带刻度的同一坐标系中，用 $x=-4,-3,-2,-1,0,1,2,3,4$ 及 $y=16,9,4,1,0,1,4,9,16$ 描点，平滑画出 $y=x^2$。每题再用下面两个点画相应直线，把交点投影到横轴读根；非整数交点在附近加密刻度和描点，以下读数约取两位小数。\n\na) 画 $y=-3x+4$，过 $(0,4),(1,1)$。交点 $(-4,16),(1,1)$，读得 $x=-4,1$。\n\nb) 画 $y=2x+5$，过 $(0,5),(1,7)$。交点约 $(-1.45,2.10),(3.45,11.90)$，读得 $x\\approx-1.45,3.45$。左交点在 -1.45 与 -1.44 之间，右交点在 3.44 与 3.45 之间。\n\nc) 画 $y=-2x-5$，过 $(0,-5),(-2,-1)$。直线不与抛物线相交，故没有实数根。为排除画面范围之外的交点，检查竖直距离 $x^2-(-2x-5)=(x+1)^2+4\\ge4$：直线在所有实数横坐标处都严格低于抛物线。\n\nd) 画 $y=\\frac12x+\\frac32$，过 $(0,1.5),(1,2)$。交点 $(-1,1),(1.5,2.25)$，读得 $x=-1,1.5$。\n\ne) 画 $y=-\\frac23x+\\frac53$，过 $(-2,3),(1,1)$。交点约 $(-1.67,2.78),(1,1)$，读得 $x\\approx-1.67,1$。左交点在 -1.67 与 -1.66 之间。\n\nf) 画 $y=-\\frac{12}{5}x+2$，过 $(0,2),(-2,6.8)$。交点约 $(-3.05,9.33),(0.65,0.43)$，读得 $x\\approx-3.05,0.65$。左交点在 -3.06 与 -3.05 之间，右交点在 0.65 与 0.66 之间。\n\n以上是作图和图读数的答案。精确值只作坐标校验：a) $(x+4)(x-1)=0$；b) $(x-1)^2=6$，所以精确根为 $1\\pm\\sqrt6$；d) $(2x-3)(x+1)=0$；e) $(3x+5)(x-1)=0$，精确根为 $-\\frac53,1$；f) $(5x+6)^2=86$，精确根为 $\\frac{-6\\pm\\sqrt{86}}5$，与上述近似交点一致。",
      "tasks": [
