    {
      "exercise": "854",
      "grading": "ungraded",
      "source": "derived",
      "parts": [],
      "displayAnswer": "先检查原式有意义：$x+y=7.8\\ne0$，$y-x=-9\\ne0$，$y^2-x^2=-70.2\\ne0$。括号内通分得\n$\\frac{2xy}{(y-x)(x+y)}+\\frac{x}{x+y}-\\frac{y}{y-x}=\\frac{2xy+x(y-x)-y(x+y)}{(y-x)(x+y)}=\\frac{-(y-x)^2}{(y-x)(x+y)}=-\\frac{y-x}{x+y}=\\frac{15}{13}\\ne0$。\n所以原式 $=\\frac{(y-x)^2}{x+y}\\div\\left(-\\frac{y-x}{x+y}\\right)=-(y-x)=x-y=8.4-(-0.6)=9$。\n直接代入再校验：括号内三项依次为 $\\frac{28}{195},\\frac{14}{13},-\\frac1{15}$，合为 $\\frac{15}{13}$；括号外为 $\\frac{135}{13}$，相除确得 9。",
